WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.440
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a Chinese Fantasy Romance film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Oversize Love.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:22.880
Xiaoxi is a young photographer who owns&nbsp;
an at-home studio somewhere in east China.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:27.120
She is always around beautiful women&nbsp;
for shoots which makes her extremely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:32.160
insecure about her overweight body. Although&nbsp;
Xiaoxi has tried many methods to lose weight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.360
she never seems to be successful. As a&nbsp;
hobby, she loves chasing after celebrities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:43.360
Her current obsession is an actor and model named&nbsp;
Huangke. While reading one of his interviews,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:49.520
she comes across a comment claiming that he only&nbsp;
likes girls who are forty-five kgs or below. Right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:55.440
after, Xiaoxi gets on the scale and sees that she&nbsp;
is almost double the weight. Her friend asks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:00.400
to not feel bad about her body because she has&nbsp;
managed to land a handsome friend like Han.
&nbsp;

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:05.440
Han has been Xiaoxi's companion since middle&nbsp;
school. He is currently a famous music producer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:10.800
and is still best friends with her. When Xiaoxi's&nbsp;
friend suggests she date him, she claims that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.920
are just friends. Deep down, she believes that&nbsp;
Han would never be with someone like her. 
&nbsp;

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:20.160
Han and Xiaoxi have a tradition of meeting&nbsp;
at the park every Saturday to exercise.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:25.520
When her friend reminds her of the date, Xiaoxi&nbsp;
rushes to the park. A flashback shows us the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:31.040
day Han and Xiaoxi met for the first time. In&nbsp;
contrast to now, Han used to be the overweight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:36.640
one in middle school. He was bullied regularly by&nbsp;
his classmates but couldn't speak up for himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:41.120
He also didn’t have many friends, so when&nbsp;
Xiaoxi saved him from the bullies one day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.480
he instantly became attached to her. She was&nbsp;
the first person to recognize his musical talent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.880
and the one who made him pursue his dreams.
Back in the present, they meet at a park to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:56.320
exercise. Half an hour into the workout, Xiaoxi&nbsp;
falls to the ground. As per the tradition,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.320 --> 00:02:01.600
they go to their favorite street-side restaurant&nbsp;
and eat a lot of food. The bystanders are shocked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:07.200
to see the amount of food Xiaoxi can eat alone&nbsp;
but it doesn’t bother Han in the least. He has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:11.120
never had a problem with her weight and&nbsp;
always tells her she is beautiful. 
&nbsp;

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:15.520
One day, the friends go shopping for clothes.&nbsp;
Buying clothes has always been difficult for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:20.240
Xiaoxi as an overweight woman. She tries on&nbsp;
a white dress that tears down the neckline&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.640
because of her size. She embarrassingly&nbsp;
has to buy it because of the damage. 
&nbsp;

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:29.600
On their way back home, Han asks her what she&nbsp;
wants for her birthday but Xiaoxi jokes that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:34.080
she wants a handsome man to date her.
After the two separate, Xiaoxi finds an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:39.440
abandoned rabbit on the road. She feels bad for&nbsp;
it and brings it home but fails to notice that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:45.440
its eyes are glowing. The following morning, a&nbsp;
crew of people knock at her door wanting to shoot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:51.120
in the studio because of a last-minute change. 
She allows them after finding out the model of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:57.920
shoot is her celebrity crush Huangke. The entire&nbsp;
shoot feels like a dream to her. Later, Huangke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:03.440
tells her that she has pretty eyes and could be a&nbsp;
model if she loses weight. But then, she overhears&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:09.200
his assistant calling her ugly, asking him to&nbsp;
stay away from people like her for his image. 
&nbsp;

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:14.080
Starting the next day, she wraps her legs&nbsp;
with plastic, eats healthy, takes supplements,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:20.080
and exercises harder than ever. But even after two&nbsp;
weeks of hard work she barely loses one kilogram.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:25.520
That night, she accidentally breaks the sofa with&nbsp;
her weight and falls flat to the ground. As she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:31.840
lies hopelessly, she notices the rabbit moving&nbsp;
around, almost like it is leading her somewhere.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:37.360
She follows the animal and reaches an abandoned&nbsp;
mansion in the neighborhood. When she enters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:44.160
the house, the floor swallows her into a colorful&nbsp;
upside-down room. Xiaoxi panics and tries to move&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:49.520
but gravity doesn’t seem to work in the room.
Then, an old man appears in front of her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:55.520
asking her to make a wish. Initially, Xiaoxi&nbsp;
freaks out and tries to run away but the lack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.520 --> 00:04:01.360
of gravity only makes her float. When she calms&nbsp;
down, the man gives her a blue potion called the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:07.680
Dream Fixer. It is supposed to make her dream come&nbsp;
true in an instant. Although skeptical at first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:13.360
Xiaoxi takes a gulp of it and goes to bed. When&nbsp;
she wakes up the next morning, she can almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:18.960
not recognize herself in the mirror. Her body&nbsp;
has shrunk significantly, making her slim. For&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:23.840
a few minutes, she lays on the bed, trying to&nbsp;
take everything in. Then, she gets a call from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:28.640
her friend asking her to bring the pictures from&nbsp;
the last photoshoot to Huangke’s assistant.
&nbsp;

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:33.440
When none of her clothes fit, Xiaoxi wears the&nbsp;
one that she had to buy because of the damage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:38.080
On her way to Huangke’s hotel, the people she&nbsp;
knew before do not recognize her while the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:44.320
bypassers turn around to admire her beauty. 
Similarly, Huangke is also smitten by her. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:50.160
comments that he has seen her before but doesn’t&nbsp;
know where. Suddenly, Xiaoxi’s chest starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:55.440
getting bigger followed by her back. Realizing&nbsp;
that she is turning back to her older self,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.440 --> 00:05:00.800
she runs away without an explanation.
At night, she again takes the potion and by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:05.600
morning, she gets skinny for the second time. Han&nbsp;
arrives at the house worried because she hasn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:11.280
picked up her phone for an entire day. He barges&nbsp;
in to see her wearing a headscarf. Initially, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:17.680
pretends to be Xiaoxi’s friend to avoid explaining&nbsp;
the situation but Han recognizes her instantly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:22.480
He had never seen her as less beautiful because&nbsp;
of her weight so even though she is significantly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:27.200
thin, he doesn’t notice much difference. 
Xiaoxi tells him about the potion and what it does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:32.160
to the human body. Han doesn’t want to believe&nbsp;
it but the result is right in front of him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:36.880
Minutes later, she yet again turns fat and&nbsp;
finds out that the effect of the potion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:41.840
only lasts for ten hours. Han doesn’t like&nbsp;
that she is changing her body unnaturally.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:47.440
He also feels jealous of the actor Huangke knowing&nbsp;
that she took the potion to impress him. 
&nbsp;

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:51.360
Han’s assistant who is in the fashion&nbsp;
industry takes it upon himself to give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:55.920
Xiaoxi a makeover. After a week of trying&nbsp;
out different hairstyles and facials,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.920 --> 00:06:01.200
Xiaoxi turns into a beautiful young woman, a&nbsp;
complete contrast from how she was prior.
&nbsp;

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:07.120
Meanwhile, Han hires Huangke to model for his&nbsp;
next music video. On the set, Huangke claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:12.480
that he doesn’t feel the chemistry with the female&nbsp;
lead and wants someone who is prettier. Offended,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:18.720
the female lead quits and storms off the set.&nbsp;
Just then, Xiaoxi arrives looking more stunning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:24.800
than ever. Huangke suggests they use her as the&nbsp;
model since she has the body and face for it. 
&nbsp;

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:30.080
Initially, Han doesn’t approve of it but when the&nbsp;
director supports the idea, he has no way but to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:36.240
agree. For the next week, the team meets every&nbsp;
day for the shoot. Xiaoxi fangirls over Huangke,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:41.760
making Han jealous. He takes his frustration out&nbsp;
by pointing out little flaws in Huangke's acting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.760 --> 00:06:48.160
and making him take several shots. An unsaid&nbsp;
rivalry is established between the guys. One day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:53.760
the director adds a kissing scene to the script.&nbsp;
Han is absolutely against the idea so instead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:58.240
he makes them cover their faces with an umbrella&nbsp;
to make it look like they are kissing. 
&nbsp;

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:04.000
The following day, Huangke invites Xiaoxi out on&nbsp;
a date. They go to the movies but notice that Han&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:08.080
is right behind their seat. When asked what&nbsp;
he is doing there, he claims that it is only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:12.800
a coincidence. Everywhere the couple goes,&nbsp;
he follows behind, acting like he is going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:17.360
the same way. Even when they book a private&nbsp;
cabin at a restaurant, he stands by the door&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:22.560
to keep an eye on them. When it starts to get&nbsp;
dark, Xiaoxi wants to return home but Huangke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:27.120
insists she come to a party with his friends. 
A few minutes into meeting his friend group,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:32.800
her fingers start to swell, followed by her&nbsp;
entire arm. She rushes to the bathroom and hides&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:38.080
inside a stall crying hysterically. Outside,&nbsp;
Huangke and his friends are waiting for her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:43.360
leaving her no way to escape. Just when the&nbsp;
truth is about to be outed, Han comes to save&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:48.640
her in a mascot costume. He makes her wear it&nbsp;
and brings her out without Huangke noticing. 
&nbsp;

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:53.680
Huangke sees Han talking to another overweight&nbsp;
woman and claims that he can do much better than&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.680 --> 00:08:00.160
a random fat girl. Xiaoxi hears the comment and&nbsp;
is left disheartened. She knows that Huangke only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:05.840
likes her because of her beauty but cannot seem&nbsp;
to let go of the idea of them being together. 
&nbsp;

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:10.960
Han drops her home and tells her that she is&nbsp;
not the person she used to be. He also assures&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:16.320
her she will get plenty of guys even if she&nbsp;
remains the way she is. Xiaoxi knows he is lying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:21.680
because even he could never see her as more than&nbsp;
a friend. A flashback reveals that in high school,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:27.280
Xiaoxi was in love with Han. But one day, she&nbsp;
overheard Han’s friend making fun of her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:32.640
Han saying that he doesn’t like her in that way.&nbsp;
She stopped trying to pursue him after that. 
&nbsp;

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:38.000
Later, Han and his friend are drinking when the&nbsp;
guy asks him if he regrets not asking Xiaoxi out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:42.720
when she was still fat. Han remembers the&nbsp;
time in high school when he heard Xiaoxi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:47.360
tell her friends that she had no feelings&nbsp;
for him. Because of the miscommunication,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:51.600
they never expressed their feelings to each&nbsp;
other even though they were in love.
&nbsp;

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:55.520
The following evening, their filing crew&nbsp;
meets at a restaurant to celebrate the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.520 --> 00:09:01.120
last day of the shoot. Han and Huangke meet in&nbsp;
the bathroom and get into a slight altercation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:05.440
The conflict quickly turns into a physical&nbsp;
fight. The others from the crew have to drag&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:10.400
them away from each other to stop them. 
Later, Han and Xiaoxi walk back home together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:15.280
He asks her to think about how Huangke will&nbsp;
react if she goes back to being fat. 
&nbsp;

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.760
In turn, Xiaoxi claims that Han hasn’t&nbsp;
treated her any better. When she mentions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:25.760
the time he was bullied, Han’s eyes glow as the&nbsp;
rabbit’s did earlier. Xiaoxi doesn’t notice it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.880
distracted by the fact that he&nbsp;
doesn’t remember getting bullied. 
&nbsp;

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:34.160
In the next scene, Xiaoxi and Huangke are out&nbsp;
on a dinner date. Xiaoxi asks him if he would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:38.400
like her the same if she were to gain weight.&nbsp;
Huangke replies that they should talk about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:43.760
positive things like her upcoming acting career.&nbsp;
It is clear to her that he won’t think twice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:49.520
before leaving her if he sees her real self. After&nbsp;
dinner, she goes to the old mansion yet again and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:55.280
asks the miracle man for a permanent potion.
He gives her the potion but warns her that it will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.280 --> 00:10:00.560
cause a side effect on her life that she might&nbsp;
not like. Blinded by the need to be Huangke’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:06.720
girlfriend, Xiaoxi takes the potion. At the&nbsp;
same time, Han starts to lose memories of her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:11.040
He only remembers that she was someone&nbsp;
he used to know in his childhood. 
&nbsp;

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.760
The next day is the release-day of the music&nbsp;
video. Xiaoxi walks into a hall for a press&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:20.720
conference when she notices the crew looking at&nbsp;
her differently. She tries talking to Huangke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:25.920
but he ignores her. When they are surrounded&nbsp;
by the reporters, she finds out that the rumor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:30.560
about her getting liposuction has circulated&nbsp;
on the internet. Since being seen with her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:35.760
is not a good PR move for Huangke, he announces&nbsp;
that he is in a relationship with someone else.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:40.560
Some fans in the crowd throw their drink&nbsp;
at Xiaoxi for lying about her beauty. 
&nbsp;

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:45.600
Han saves her from the media and brings her&nbsp;
upstairs. Xiaoxi soon realizes that he only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:51.280
remembers the overweight Xiaoxi and thinks that he&nbsp;
hasn’t met her for a while. She tries to show him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:56.960
their pictures together but her face is missing in&nbsp;
all of them. She breaks down crying but Han thinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:02.080
she is in shock from what happened earlier. 
A week later, Huangke comes to her house. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:07.760
welcomes him in, expecting him to apologize but&nbsp;
he asks her to convince Han to sell him a song.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:12.480
On finding out he just wants to use her for&nbsp;
her influence, she asks him to get out. 
&nbsp;

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:17.280
Following the encounter, Xiaoxi rushes to his&nbsp;
office and finds a picture of them from high&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:22.320
school. She finally realizes that she never&nbsp;
stopped loving Han and has been suppressing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:28.000
her feelings till now. After that, she goes&nbsp;
to the abandoned house again, this time to ask&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:33.360
the man to send her back to her normal self. 
The man gives her a last chance and allows her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:38.480
transform. After turning fat again, Xiaoxi&nbsp;
runs to the playground and meets Han. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:43.520
he calls her by her name, she breaks down&nbsp;
crying, relieved that he remembers her. 
&nbsp;

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:47.760
One year later, the couple is at their&nbsp;
favorite street-side restaurant. By now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:52.960
Xiaoxi has turned fit while Han has gained a&nbsp;
significant amount of weight. The movie ends as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:58.000
she tells him that she loves him either way. 
